# Package list for the mxniri flavour: MX 25.2 AHS (systemd) with the niri
# Wayland compositor instead of the Xfce desktop.
#
# Same applications as the MX Xfce AHS edition. Only the Xfce desktop itself
# (panel and plugins, session, settings, window manager, desktop, notifications,
# power manager, screensaver, screenshooter, clipman, appfinder, superkey) is
# gone, replaced by the niri session block at the end of this file.
#
# niri and xwayland-satellite are not in the Debian/MX repositories: they are
# installed from Deb/mxniri/ (see Tools/build-niri-debs.sh).

